      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ONCE MORE (6) was below best at his last couple, the latest finishing fifth at Warragul, but was among the placings at this track three back. Look for sharp improvement here. LAKEVIEW CHASER (1) was well fancied last time on the strength of the win two back but could only manage second (26.26) at Warragul. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Will give a great sight again. WAX OFF (4) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 2.5 lengths into third (29.01) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 510m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Must be included in calculations. ELIJAH ROSE (7) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
